usage: capture_bench.py [-h] --gateway GATEWAY --client CLIENT
                        [--seconds SECONDS] --out OUT

Capture two serial ports without flashing or changing configuration. Run with
the PlatformIO virtual-environment Python (includes pyserial). Opening a
serial port can toggle DTR/RTS on some boards; record any reset.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --gateway GATEWAY  Gateway COM port
  --client CLIENT    Client COM port
  --seconds SECONDS
  --out OUT          New run directory
